11. AUTOMATIC SALARY CALCULATION ENGINE

Build a centralized and tested payroll calculation engine.

Hourly wage calculation

Regular Pay = Approved Regular Hours × Base Hourly Rate.

Overtime Pay = Approved Overtime Hours × Configured Overtime Base Rate × Applicable Multiplier.

Gross Salary = Regular Pay + Overtime Pay + Applicable Allowances.

Daily wage calculation

Basic Daily Pay = Configured Daily Rate × Applicable Attendance Fraction.

Overtime Pay = Approved Overtime Hours × Configured Overtime Base Rate × Applicable Multiplier.

Gross Salary = Basic Daily Pay + Overtime Pay + Applicable Allowances.

Monthly salary calculation

Calculate monthly basic salary according to the configured monthly payroll policy.

Add eligible overtime, allowances and other applicable earnings.

Apply only authorized deductions.

Automatic recalculation

When relevant attendance, overtime, salary rates or approved expense records change:

- Recalculate draft payroll.
- Update dashboard totals.
- Update worker salary statements.
- Update applicable reports.

Do not silently modify finalized payroll.

Use accurate decimal arithmetic and consistent rounding.

Display the complete calculation breakdown.

